            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ekhumaliilikha, se khwanyala khu khwekhaliilikha lundi tawe. Nio khwakhalaka khukhwikhala mu Ateni fweng'ene ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mala khwaruma Timoteo, wandaayefwe okholanga ne nafwe khulwa Wele mu khwilwacha Elomo Endayi eya Kristo. Khwamuruma khwinywe amuandalasie mu lisuubila lienywe lundi amuchuube, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nio yesi yesi khwinywe akhela enyuma sikila binyaasio bino tawe. Enywe mwabeene mu manyile muli binyaasio biri, bili bilala khu lienya lia Wele khwifwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila nga khwaba ne khu siili ne nanywe, khwanyoa khwamuboolela khuli khulikho khucha khunyaasibwa, ne nga ne mu manyile bulayi bwene, ako niko busa kamene kakekholekha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ako niko kakakila naruma Timoteo. Beele se nyala khukhwekhaliilikha lundi tawe, nio namuruma manye lisuubila lienywe. Naba ne buuri ndi wakana abeele Omusiku amukhakile enywe mala kimilimo kiefwe kiabele kia busa!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
